            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.32.11+EXO.32.12+EXO.32.13+EXO.32.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nia 32.11-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento Moses owaco bot Rwot ni, “Jo Ejipt dok gibiwinyo pire bene, pien in aye yam itiŋo jo man ki tekki ikwanyogi woko ki i kingi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "dok gibitito bot jo ma gibedo i lobo man, Doŋ gityeko winyo ni in Rwot it ye i dye jo man, dok ni in Rwot aye gibedo ka neni waŋ ki waŋ, ki pol meri obedo ka cuŋ ka wigi, dok ibedo ka wot i nyimgi i wir pol dyeceŋ ki i wir mac dyewor. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka ineko jo man woko lawaŋe acel, ci lurok ma giwinyo ywekani gibiwacci, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Onoŋo tero jo man i lobo ma yam okwoŋo pire ni ebimiyo botgi-ni doŋ oloyo Rwot woko, en mumiyo onekogi woko i dye tim-mi.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kombeddi alegi ni, wek tek pa Rwot obed madit kit macalo yam iciko kun iwacci, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.20.5+EXO.20.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nia 20.5-6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.34.6+EXO.34.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "34.6-7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.5.9+DEU.5.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nwo 5.9-10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.7.9+DEU.7.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "7.9-10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Rwot kiniga pe mako oyot, mar mere ma pe lokke dwoŋ; en weko bal ki tim aranyi pa dano, ento pe kwanyo kop i kom lubalo. En keto can i kom likwayo ki i kom Likwayo pa likwayogi pi bal pa kwarogi nio i yalwak me adek ki me aŋwen.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alegi ni itim kica ki joni man pi rocgi, macalo in marri ma pe lokke dwoŋ twatwal-li, kit ma ibedo ka weko balgi cakke wa ki i Ejipt nio koni.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwot ogamo ni, “Doŋ atimo kica botgi kit macalo iwaco-ni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.3.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ibru 3.18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento ada, macalo atye kwo-ni, dok macalo deyo pa Rwot bipono lobo ducu-ni, akwoŋo ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "i kom jo ma guneno deyona ki lwak lanyut ma yam atiyo i Ejipt ki i tim, ento ma gubedo ka omo iya ma doŋ odoko tyen apar kulu, ma pe guwinyo doga bene, pe tye ŋat mo i kingi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ma bineno lobo ma yam akwoŋo pire bot kwarogi ni abimiyogini; pe tye ŋat mo i kin jo ma gicaya ma bineno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.14.9+JOS.14.10+JOS.14.11+JOS.14.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoc 14.9-12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento laticca Kaleb abitero i lobo ma yam ocito iye-ni, ci Likwaye bicamo, pien en tye ki cwiny mapat, dok en tye ka lubo gin ma amito ducu kakare atir. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jo Amalek ki jo Kanaan gibedo i nota ducu; pi meno wun diki wulokke wucak wot wudok tun tim i yo ma kemo Nam Makwar.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwot dok owaco bot Moses ki bot Aron ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Lwak man marac-ci gibiweko ŋuro i koma awene? Doŋ atyeko winyo lwak nuro ma jo Icrael gitye ka ŋuro kwede i koma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wac botgi ni an Rwot awacci, ‘Macalo atye makwo-ni, gin ma doŋ wuwaco ma awinyo ki ita abitiyo botwu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.3.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ibru 3.17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Komwu muto biradde piny i dye tim man. I kin jo ma gikwanogi-ni, ma yam gikwano welgi cakke ki i kom jo ma ditogi romo mwaka pyeraryo dok kwede malo, ma gubedo ka nur i koma-ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "pe acel mo bio i lobo ma yam akwoŋo pire ni abimiyogi bedo iye; kono Kaleb wod pa Jepune ki Yocwa wod pa Nun keken aye gibio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento litinowu ma wuwacci gibiyakogi wokoni, gin aye abiterogi kunnu, gin aye gibiŋeyo lobo ma wun wucayo-ru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wun aye komwu muto biradde piny i dye tim man. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.7.36"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tic 7.36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Litinowu gibibedo lukwat i tim mwaka pyeraŋwen kun gineno can pi tarwaŋwu atata, nio ka kom danowu ma oto me agikkine obuto i dye tim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wubineno can pi balwu mwaka pyeraŋwen, muporo wel nino ma yam wuroto ki lobo-ni, nino pyeraŋwen, mwaka acel pi nino acel acel, ci wubineyo ni iya oarre woko i komwu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "An a Rwot ma doŋ aloko; ada abitiyo man i kom lwak man marac-ci ducu ma guribbe me pyem kweda; gibitum woko i dye tim kany, gibito megi kunnu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jo ma yam Moses ocwalo ka roto lobo-ni, ma yam gudwogo ci gumiyo lwak ducu guŋur i kom Rwot pi lok marac ma gutito i kom lobo-nu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "jo-nu guto woko ki two gemo i nyim Rwot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento Yocwa wod pa Nun ki Kaleb wod pa Jepune aye gudoŋ ma gikwo ki i kin lwak dano ma gucito ka roto lobo-ni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moses otito lok meno ducu bot jo Icrael, ci dano gukok matek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci gua malo odiko con, gucito guito malo wa i lacol me lobo godi, kun giwaco ni, “Nen, wan doŋ watye kany co do, doŋ wabicito wa i kabedo ma Rwot ociko pire; pien doŋ wabalo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento Moses owaco botgi ni, “Piŋo wun koni wuturo cik ma Rwot oketo? Pien meno pe bitwerre wacel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pe wucit kunnu, wek pe lumerokwu guradwu woko piny, pien Rwot pe tye i kinwu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jo Amalek ki jo Kanaan gitye i nyimwu kunnu, pala lucwangi bityekowu woko; pien wun wukwero lubo kor Rwot, miyo Rwot pe bibedo kwedwu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento gin guette ni gimito ito malo wa i lacol lobo godi ca, kadi bed canduk me gicikke pa Rwot, ki Moses bene, pe gua woko ki i gony. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci jo Amalek ki jo Kanaan ma gibedo i lobo godi kunnu gulor piny, guloyogi, ci guryemogi nio wa i Korma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
